## 🎮 USAGE WORKFLOW

### Quick Workflow (6 steps)
```
1. Open index.html in browser
2. Click "➕ Register Participant" (repeat for multiple)
3. Click "🔄 Run Clustering"
4. Click "Teams" tab to view results
5. Click "🔒 Lock" to finalize teams
6. Click "📥 Export" to download CSV
```

### Detailed Workflow (15 minutes)
```
1. Open index.html
2. Register 5-10 participants with different skills
3. View stats update in real-time
4. Switch to "Participants" tab to see full list
5. Filter by "Frontend" to verify registrations
6. Go back to Dashboard
7. Set team size to 4
8. Click "🔄 Run Clustering"
9. See alert when complete
10. Click "Teams" tab
11. Review auto-generated teams
12. Verify skill distribution
13. Lock both teams
14. Check "Audit Trail" for history
15. Export participants and teams
```

