## 💡 TIPS FOR SUCCESS

### Tip 1: Registering Participants
```
• Use realistic names
• Use valid email formats
• Select 1-3 skills per person
• Mix different skill categories
• Create diverse skill sets for better clustering
```

### Tip 2: Running Clustering
```
• Register at least 4 participants first
• Set team size based on participant count
• Allow 1-2 seconds for algorithm
• Teams are auto-balanced
• Lock teams when satisfied
```

### Tip 3: Exporting Data
```
• Always export before closing
• Save CSV files for records
• Open in Excel for reports
• Use for participant communication
• Keep backup copies
```

### Tip 4: Mobile Usage
```
• Works great on phones/tablets
• Use local server for mobile access
• Get your IP: ipconfig (Windows)
• Access from phone: http://YOUR_IP:8000
• Perfect for on-site hackathons
```

